1
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:42,530
I'm so glad everyone is asleep.

2
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:45,530
I thought Max would be crying, and everybody would be awake.

3
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:46,530
What did I tell you?

4
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:47,530
Nothing to worry about.

5
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:49,530
I'm sure everything is fine.

6
00:00:49,530 --> 00:00:51,530
My mother knows all there is to know

7
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:53,530
about taking care of babies, I assure you.

8
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:55,530
Let's put some of this stuff away and then take off.

9
00:00:55,530 --> 00:00:57,530
We've got a forty-minute drive into the city.

10
00:00:57,530 --> 00:01:06,530
Welcome home--

11
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,530
and I do mean welcome home.

12
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:14,530
Something wrong?

13
00:01:14,530 --> 00:01:17,530
Oh, nothing's wrong, Richard.

14
00:01:17,530 --> 00:01:19,530
Believe me, Max is fine.

15
00:01:19,530 --> 00:01:23,530
But his teeth hurt, and he just can't get to sleep, poor dear.

16
00:01:23,530 --> 00:01:28,530
Neither can you.

17
00:01:28,530 --> 00:01:31,530
Oh, I feel so bad.

18
00:01:31,530 --> 00:01:33,530
Oh, I'm fine.

19
00:01:33,530 --> 00:01:34,530
How was your weekend?

20
00:01:34,530 --> 00:01:36,530
We had a great time, Mom.

21
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:38,530
It was wonderful.

22
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:39,530
The weather couldn't have been better.

23
00:01:39,530 --> 00:01:42,530
It was nice here, too.

24
00:01:42,530 --> 00:01:44,530
Did you get a chance to get outside at all?

25
00:01:44,530 --> 00:01:45,530
Oh, yes.

26
00:01:45,530 --> 00:01:47,530
Grandpa helped me yesterday afternoon.

27
00:01:47,530 --> 00:01:49,530
I went to the supermarket to get a few things,

28
00:01:49,530 --> 00:01:52,530
and I stayed out an extra half hour.

29
00:01:52,530 --> 00:01:54,530
The village was filled with people--the weather was so nice.

30
00:01:54,530 --> 00:01:57,530
Harry's a professional camper, Mom. Harry

31
00:01:57,530 --> 00:01:59,530
He knows all there is to know,

32
00:01:59,530 --> 00:02:01,530
and he made the weekend very easy for us to enjoy.

33
00:02:01,530 --> 00:02:03,530
Come on. You all helped.

34
00:02:03,530 --> 00:02:05,530
You were wonderful, Harry!

35
00:02:05,530 --> 00:02:11,530
Why don't you go to your room, Mom, and get some sleep.

36
00:02:11,530 --> 00:02:13,530
Oh, I'm fine.

37
00:02:13,530 --> 00:02:15,530
Tell me more about your weekend.

38
00:02:15,530 --> 00:02:17,530
Did you do anything special?

39
00:02:17,530 --> 00:02:20,530
Lots of special country things.

40
00:02:20,530 --> 00:02:22,530
We picked flowers.

41
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:24,530
And we brought some home for you.

42
00:02:24,530 --> 00:02:28,530
It was so nice to be out in the country.

43
00:02:28,530 --> 00:02:31,530
They smell wonderful.

44
00:02:31,530 --> 00:02:33,530
Everything smelled so special.

45
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:36,530
It would have been great if we had been able to bottle the smells.

46
00:02:36,530 --> 00:02:39,530
It would be a great business if you could do that.

47
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:41,530
Oh!

48
00:02:41,530 --> 00:02:44,530
Uh, we're home now, Ellen.

49
00:02:44,530 --> 00:02:46,530
We'll take care of it.

50
00:02:46,530 --> 00:02:48,530
I'll take care of it.

51
00:02:48,530 --> 00:02:51,530
Let's see if it works.

52
00:02:51,530 --> 00:02:52,530
What's that?

53
00:02:52,530 --> 00:02:55,530
A little special country music.

54
00:02:55,530 --> 00:02:58,530
I think we'd better head home.

55
00:02:58,530 --> 00:03:00,530
It's getting late, and we have a bit of a drive.

56
00:03:00,530 --> 00:03:03,530
Well, all your things are inside.

57
00:03:03,530 --> 00:03:04,530
There's your sleeping bag.

58
00:03:04,530 --> 00:03:06,530
Oh, thanks, Harry.

59
00:03:06,530 --> 00:03:09,530
Say good-bye to Richard.

60
00:03:09,530 --> 00:03:10,530
We'll call you all tomorrow night.

61
00:03:10,530 --> 00:03:12,530
Good-bye.

62
00:03:12,530 --> 00:03:14,530
Bye, Mom.

63
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:24,530
I'm so tired I think I'm overtired.

64
00:03:24,530 --> 00:03:28,530
I don't know if I can get to sleep.

65
00:03:28,530 --> 00:03:39,530
Max has stopped crying. Max

66
00:03:39,530 --> 00:03:43,530
Yes. It works!

67
00:03:43,530 --> 00:03:45,530
It works!

68
00:03:45,530 --> 00:03:48,530
What works?

69
00:03:48,530 --> 00:03:50,530
This.

70
00:03:50,530 --> 00:04:01,530
Oh. Oh, where did you get that?

71
00:04:01,530 --> 00:04:06,530
It sounds so nice.

72
00:04:06,530 --> 00:04:15,530
I think I'm falling asleep.

73
00:04:15,530 --> 00:04:17,530
Like Max did.

74
00:04:17,530 --> 00:04:18,030
Good night.

75
00:04:18,030 --> 00:04:29,530
Sounds of the country.

76
00:04:29,530 --> 00:04:32,530
The soothing sounds of the country.
